Package: honupsy
Title: Tools for Working with Routine Psychiatric Patient Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Michael", "Ketzer", , "michael.ketzer@unibas.ch", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9633-3947"))
Description: Provides functions to import, process, and summarise routinely 
    collected psychiatric patient data, with a focus on unit-level patient 
    composition. The package supports the application of previously developed
    patient weights based on the Health of the Nation Outcome Scales (HoNOS), a 
    standardised instrument for assessing symptom severity, mental health 
    status, and social functioning in psychiatric care. These tools enable 
    hospitals to explore how unit-level patient composition relates to nurse 
    staffing, short-term workload fluctuations, and long-term strategic
    staffing planning in inpatient psychiatric settings.
